                                "sense_id": "f046cfa8-a526-3fe6-bf01-75b6f21e9c10",
                                "text": "Myself, I think it was an albino niggeress. She had red hair and the biggest feet you ever saw. But Bumpo was no end pleased with her..."
                            },
